  <name>A6 Image Studio</name>
  <summary>Generate images through A6API</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A6 Image Studio is a Linux desktop and command-line client for generating,
      previewing, and saving images through an OpenAI-compatible A6API endpoint.
    </p>
    <p>
      The desktop interface supports custom image dimensions, generation quality
      and format controls, request cancellation, recent previews, and native
      file dialogs and actions.
    </p>
  </description>
